OL,4,BMan Utd trigger Fernandes' one-year    
OL,5,Bcontract extension                     
OL,6,GManchester United have triggered their 
OL,7,Gone-year option on captain Bruno       
OL,8,GFernandes' contract.                   
OL,10,FThe 32-year-old's deal was due to      
OL,11,Fexpire next summer but sources say     
OL,12,Fboth parties decided it was in their   
OL,13,Fbest interests to activate the option  
OL,14,Fthrough to 2028.                       
OL,16,FIt means overseas clubs will not be    
OL,17,Fable to approach Fernandes when the    
OL,18,Ftransfer window opens on 1 January.    
